<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar closes flat in half day's trade.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar closes flat in half day's trade.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed flat at 475.75/476.75 per dollar in light dealing during the last half day of trade of the year, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was a quiet trading session,&quot; said one trader, adding that the Central Bank had been present &quot;but only very modestly&quot;.</p>
<p>Trading resumes on January 2.</p>
<p>((-- Maria Jose Gonzalez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
